---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: index.html
title: Play in Traffic – Free Running, Cycling & Walking Route Apps
description: "Three free iOS apps for runners, cyclists, and walkers who want to explore somewhere new. Find new routes with Random Run, BikeRight, and Go for a Walk."
styles: ["homepage"]
scripts: ["scroll-reveal"]
showFooterIcons: true
showFooterEmail: true
lastmod: 2026-08-11
alternates:
  - { lang: en, href: "/" }
  - { lang: fr, href: "/fr/" }
  - { lang: de, href: "/de/" }
  - { lang: x-default, href: "/" }
---
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "{{ site.name }}",
        "url": "{{ site.url }}",
        "logo": "{{ '/img/favicon-512.png' | absUrl(site.url) }}",
        "email": "{{ site.email }}",
        "description": "Apps for runners, cyclists, and walkers who want to explore somewhere new."
    }
    </script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "ItemList",
        "name": "Play in Traffic apps",
        "itemListElement": [
            {%- for a in apps %}
            {
                "@type": "ListItem",
                "position": {{ loop.index }},
                "item": {
                    "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
                    "name": {{ a.name | dump | safe }},
                    "operatingSystem": {{ a.os | dump | safe }},
                    "applicationCategory": "HealthApplication",
                    "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD" },
                    "url": {{ a.page | absUrl(site.url) | dump | safe }},
                    "downloadUrl": {{ a.appStoreUrl | dump | safe }}
                }
            }{{ "," if not loop.last }}
            {%- endfor %}
        ]
    }
    </script>

    <!-- ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="home-hero">
        <div class="home-hero-text">
            <span class="hero-badge">★ Three free iOS apps</span>
            <h1>Get out there.<br><em>We'll find the way.</em></h1>
            <p class="home-hero-sub">You pick the distance. We pick the streets. Free route apps for running, cycling, and walking on iPhone and Apple Watch.</p>
            <a class="hero-cta" href="#apps">Pick your adventure ↓</a>
        </div>

        <svg class="hero-hills" viewBox="0 0 1440 280" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M0,180 C240,100 420,210 720,150 C1020,90 1200,190 1440,130 L1440,280 L0,280 Z" fill="#A8D5E2" opacity="0.55"/>
            <path d="M0,210 C260,140 520,240 800,180 C1080,120 1280,230 1440,180 L1440,280 L0,280 Z" fill="#3E7C59" opacity="0.85"/>
            <path d="M0,250 C300,190 600,270 900,225 C1150,190 1320,260 1440,235 L1440,280 L0,280 Z" fill="#234A2D"/>
            <path d="M80,235 C300,205 480,245 700,215 C920,185 1140,240 1380,210" fill="none" stroke="#FAF3E3" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="2 12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="80" cy="235" r="6" fill="#F2B134"/>
            <circle cx="1380" cy="210" r="6" fill="#E8703A"/>
        </svg>
    </section>

    <!-- ── App Showcase ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="app-showcase" id="apps">
        <div class="app-showcase-head">
            <h2>Three apps, one idea</h2>
            <p>Never take the same route twice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
{%- for a in apps %}
            <div class="app-card app-card--{{ a.color }} reveal">
                <div class="app-card-header">
                    <img src="{{ a.icon128 }}" alt="{{ a.name }} app icon" class="app-card-icon" width="48" height="48">
                    <div>
                        <div class="app-card-name">{{ a.name }}</div>
                        <p class="app-card-diff">{{ a.tagline }}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="app-card-tag">Free · iOS</span>
                <div class="app-card-cta-row">
                    <a href="{{ a.page }}" class="app-card-link" data-umami-event="hub-card" data-umami-event-app="{{ a.key }}">Learn more →</a>
                    <a href="{{ a.appStoreUrl }}" class="app-card-store" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="download-click" data-umami-event-app="{{ a.key }}" aria-label="Download {{ a.name }} on the App Store">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
                        <span>App Store</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
{%- endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── What We Make ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="home-intro reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Free route apps for exploring on foot and on wheels</h2>
            <p><a href="/random-run.html">Random Run</a> is a running route generator for iPhone and Apple Watch. Pick a distance or a time and get three loop routes you've never run, starting and ending right where you stand — with turn-by-turn voice guidance and automatic Strava upload when you finish.</p>
            <p><a href="/bikeright.html">BikeRight</a> finds the safest bike route to wherever you're going. Every route is scored against your city's real cycling infrastructure — protected lanes, multi-use paths, quiet streets — and Apple Watch taps out every turn so your eyes stay on the road.</p>
            <p><a href="/go-for-a-walk.html">Go for a Walk</a> builds walking routes through your own neighbourhood with the stops you actually want: parks, coffee, landmarks, playgrounds. Three loops from your front door, each heading somewhere new.</p>
            <p>All three apps are completely free, with no accounts, no ads, and no tracking. New here? Start with our <a href="/guides/">guides to finding better routes</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Philosophy Strip ──────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="philosophy reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <p>Free. Private. No account required.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
